cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Consulting Bench, please cite it as below.
title: Consulting Bench
abstract: >-
  A Harbor benchmark of partner-memo tasks for management consulting
  workflows (market sizing, profitability, pricing, and investment
  decisions). Each task gives an agent a partner email and a synthetic
  matter pack; the agent writes a one-page memo and a checkable JSON sidecar.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Consulting Bench Authors
url: https://github.com/cbelling/consulting-bench
